graph TB
    Platform["ODH/RHOAI Platform Operator<br/>(rhods-operator)"]
    User["User / GitOps"]

    OGXCR["OGX CR<br/>components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1<br/>Cluster-scoped, default-ogx"]
    OGXServerCR["OGXServer CR<br/>ogx.io/v1beta1<br/>Namespaced"]
    LSD["LlamaStackDistribution<br/>llamastack.io/v1alpha1<br/>legacy, adoption only"]

    subgraph ModuleDeploy["opendatahub-ogx-operator Deployment (ogx-module)"]
        InitCopy["copy-manifests init container<br/>/manifests to emptyDir"]
        ModuleMgr["ogx-module manager<br/>metrics 8443/TCP HTTPS, health 8081/TCP"]
        OGXCtrl["OGX controller<br/>render + apply + GC<br/>OGXServer health aggregation"]
        InitCopy --> ModuleMgr
        ModuleMgr --> OGXCtrl
    end

    subgraph OperatorDeploy["ogx-k8s-operator-controller-manager Deployment"]
        Mgr["ogx-k8s-operator manager<br/>webhook 9443, metrics 8443, health 8081"]
        ServerCtrl["OGXServer controller"]
        Webhook["Validating webhook<br/>vogxserver.kb.io"]
        ConfigGen["Config generator<br/>pkg/config"]
        Kustomize["Kustomize deployer<br/>embedded manifests/base"]
        Mgr --> ServerCtrl
        Mgr --> Webhook
        ServerCtrl --> ConfigGen
        ServerCtrl --> Kustomize
    end

    subgraph PerCR["Per-OGXServer resources (CR namespace)"]
        Deploy["OGX server Deployment<br/>odh-ogx-core / distribution image"]
        Svc["Service name-service<br/>ClusterIP 8321/TCP HTTP"]
        CM["ConfigMap name-config-hash<br/>/etc/ogx/config.yaml"]
        NP["NetworkPolicy"]
        SA["ServiceAccount + RoleBinding<br/>nonroot-v2 SCC"]
        Opt["Optional: PVC, HPA, PDB,<br/>ServiceMonitor, PrometheusRule"]
        Ing["Ingress (legacy mode only)<br/>edge TLS"]
        MigJob["Praxis migration Job"]
    end

    Platform -->|creates| OGXCR
    OGXCR -->|watched by| OGXCtrl
    OGXCtrl -->|installs CRD, RBAC, Deployment,<br/>webhook, monitoring| OperatorDeploy

    User -->|creates| OGXServerCR
    OGXServerCR -->|validated by| Webhook
    OGXServerCR -->|watched by| ServerCtrl
    ServerCtrl -.->|adopts PVC/Service/Ingress| LSD
    ConfigGen -->|generates| CM
    Kustomize -->|creates| Deploy
    Kustomize -->|creates| Svc
    Kustomize -->|creates| NP
    Kustomize -->|creates| SA
    Kustomize -->|creates| Opt
    Kustomize -->|creates| Ing
    ServerCtrl -->|creates| MigJob
    ServerCtrl -->|polls /v1/providers, /v1/version| Svc
    CM -->|mounted| Deploy

    ServerCtrl -->|OCI config labels| Registry["Container Registry<br/>HTTPS, HTTP fallback"]
    Mgr -->|TLS profile| APIServer["OpenShift APIServer cluster"]
    Mgr -->|serving certs| ServiceCA["OpenShift service-ca"]
    Opt -.->|scraped by| Prom["prometheus-operator"]
    Praxis["Praxis Gateway"] -->|Praxis mode traffic| Svc

    style Mgr fill:#4a90e2
    style ServerCtrl fill:#4a90e2
    style Webhook fill:#4a90e2
    style ConfigGen fill:#4a90e2
    style Kustomize fill:#4a90e2
    style ModuleMgr fill:#4a90e2
    style OGXCtrl fill:#4a90e2
    style InitCopy fill:#4a90e2
    style OGXCR fill:#f5a623
    style OGXServerCR fill:#f5a623
    style LSD fill:#f5d5a0,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style Registry fill:#e8e8e8
    style APIServer fill:#e8e8e8
    style ServiceCA fill:#e8e8e8
    style Prom fill:#e8e8e8
    style Platform fill:#7ed321
    style Praxis fill:#7ed321
